.Dd October 16, 2026
.Dt LCC-MENU 1
.Os @PROJECT_VERSION@

.Sh NAME
.Nm lcc-menu
.Nd configure the Lumina desktop context menu.

.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | -help
.Op Fl v | -version

.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is part of the Lumina Control Center.
It controls the items shown in the menu that appears when the desktop is
right-clicked.
Menu plugins can be added, removed and reordered.
Items can also be added for a specific installed application or for a
custom script or command.

.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Display help on command line options.
.It Fl v , Fl -version
Display version information.
.El

.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/bin/lcc-menu
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/lumina-desktop/desktopsettings.conf
The menu item list is stored under
.Qq menu/itemlist .
.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lcc 1 ,
.Xr lcc-panels 1 ,
.Xr lumina-desktop 1

